## 1. Definitions

"Academic/Research Use" means non-commercial teaching, scholarship, academic
research, or publication by an educational institution, student, faculty
member, researcher, or non-profit research organization.

"Affiliate" means any entity that directly or indirectly controls, is
controlled by, or is under common control with a party. "Control" means
ownership of more than fifty percent (50%) of the voting interests of an
entity, or the power to direct management or policies of the entity.

"Annual Gross Revenue" means the total gross revenue, receipts, and other
consideration recognized by Licensee and its Affiliates on a consolidated
basis during the most recently completed fiscal year, or, if no fiscal year
has been completed, during the trailing twelve (12) months. Annual Gross
Revenue is measured before deductions for costs or expenses and excludes
sales, use, value-added, or similar taxes collected solely for remittance to
government authorities.

"Commercial Deployment" means any use of the Software, or of a product or
service that includes, embeds, depends on, is powered by, or is materially
enabled by the Software, where the product or service is provided, licensed,
sold, leased, hosted, operated, managed, or otherwise made available to
customers, clients, end users, or third parties for a commercial purpose.
Commercial Deployment includes SaaS, managed services, hosted offerings,
OEM/integrator resale, paid support bundles, and embedding the Software into a
commercial product or service.

"Commercial License" means a separate written commercial license agreement with
Vitruvian Systems LLC.

"Internal Evaluation" means internal testing, prototyping, proof-of-concept,
or technical evaluation by a person or entity for its own internal decision
making.

"Personal Use" means private, individual, non-commercial use by a natural
person for hobby, learning, tinkering, or experimentation.

"Small Entity Use" means use by a person or entity, including its Affiliates,
whose Annual Gross Revenue is less than USD $1,000,000.

"Software" means the source code, object code, documentation, configuration,
media, and other materials made available in this repository.

