- Small Entity Use.

For clarity, Small Entity Use may be internal or commercial and may include
hosting, customer-facing deployment, embedding, resale, OEM or integrator
distribution, and other Commercial Deployment, so long as the licensee and its
Affiliates remain below the USD $1,000,000 Annual Gross Revenue threshold.

You may share source or binary copies, including modified versions, only if:

